    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1237">

                <pb facs="0908" n="832" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg832"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.812/189</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-04-07T15:00:00-05:45">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 7, 1916, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Nicaraguan Senate passed Canal Treaty unanimously to-day. Navas, one of the
                    liberal Senators did not vote but filed protest. Treaty transmitted to the
                    House. Probably House will finish debate and take final vote next week.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jefferson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
